 ("Investigations?", ["Gram stain of ulcer edge (school of fish), culture on enriched GC agar/Mueller–Hinton with haemin and vancomycin (difficult; transport quickly), multiplex PCR (most sensitive), biopsy (three zones: superficial necrosis, middle vascular zone with endothelial proliferation, deep plasma cell/lymphocyte infiltrate)", "Always test for syphilis (DGI, VDRL/TPHA) and HIV"]),
